video='<div class="video"><div class="ratio">'+iframe.group(0)+'</div>'+p('选看示范：同步空间（1:34），B 站 SClP-L · 2022；只演示同步，不替代独立备份。','Optional demonstration: sync spaces (1:34), Bilibili SClP-L · 2022. It demonstrates sync; it does not replace independent backup.')+'</div>' if iframe else ''
write('activity-workspace-rehearsal.html','选读：工作台搭建跟做','Optional: workspace setup walkthrough',h(1,'选读：工作台搭建跟做','Optional: workspace setup walkthrough')+p('这是起点营地第 3 步的补充说明，不是第二份必做任务。已搭好就跳过；视频选看，额外阅读不计入 120 分钟。快捷键练习在山脊。','This explains Base Camp step 3 in more detail; it is not a second required task. Skip if already set up. The clip is optional; extra reference reading is outside the 120 minutes. Shortcut practice is on the Ridge.')+video+h(2,'按四角检查','Check the four corners')+'<ol>'+''.join('<li>'+bi(*t)+'</li>' for t in [('文件：在已有云盘或本地课程文件夹建作业、网站备份、笔记三个文件夹，用移动或拖放归位课程文件。不要整理其他人的文件。','Files: in existing cloud storage or a local course folder, create assignments, site-backups and notes folders. Move or drag course files into place; leave other people’s files alone.'),('时间：在已有日历设每周外部课程提醒，提前 10 分钟，起点为第 11 周（公开学习者：开始 M3 的那周），时段与选课页一致。遇假期将该次学习顺延到下一个工作日。','Time: in your existing calendar, set the weekly external-course reminder 10 minutes ahead, starting in Week 11 (open learners: the week you start M3). Match the choice-page slot. Shift holiday sessions to the next working day.'),('笔记：固定一个落点，存一条学习笔记，抄来的话带三行来源。','Notes: choose one fixed home, save a learning note, and give quoted words their three source lines.'),('备份：把课程文件保存为独立副本，打开确认；再找一次原来的旧文件，记下秒数。','Backup: save an independent course-file copy and open it. Find the original old file again and note the seconds.')])+'</ol>'+faq+links([('base-camp.html','← 起点营地第 3 步','← Base Camp step 3'),('index.html','任务地图','Quest map')]),'tier')
# Supporting pages: preserve teaching content; replace old navigation and obsolete assignment summary.
